{"id":"m4-045","m":4,"paper":"2016年江苏省公务员录用考试《行测》题（C类）","region":"江苏","year":2016,"q":8,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"1791776","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f7503efd18b5bc8f.png\" />，2，10，70，（  ）。</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"770"},{"k":"B","t":"723"},{"k":"C","t":"760"},{"k":"D","t":"1400"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列各项存在明显的倍数关系，优先考虑<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>商。<span style=\"color:#rgb(89,89,89)\">作</span>商后得到新数列：2、3、5、7、（），为连续质数列，下一项应为11。故<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7cd831e0a13b9896.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"1791778","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"-12，-7，2，19，52，（  ）。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"62"},{"k":"B","t":"77"},{"k":"C","t":"97"},{"k":"D","t":"117"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>数列无明显特征，优先考虑作差。作差后得到新数列：5、9、17、33、（）；再次作差后得：4、8、16、（），为公比是2的等比数列，故下一项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c355405e6c98b528.png\" />。反推上一级数列括号内应为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d3a59e703bd3fd0.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8ad4dfcf5e51cff4.png\" />。<br> 故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"1791780","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f02be641ee4a0b4.png\" />， 3<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0bd48302fc200a2f.png\" />， 4<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-be8371a042ee408c.png\" />， 3<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d51238aed10f7336.png\" />， 6<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c735a2beb92b2972.png\" />，（  ）。</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p>12</p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e01f2e0af5d081c9.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fdf146ac66df1284.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p>144</p>"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>将各项根号外数字均转化到根号内，可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f02be641ee4a0b4.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5a5b0ce14912d108.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b853660740d22e2d.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6b06a401e4424494.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7eba7676bc51887e.png\" />、（）。根号内数字相邻后一项与前一项作差后得：3、3、6、18、（），相邻后一项与前一项两两作商分别为：1、2、3、（4），故上一级下一项应为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-797cb517ee468f45.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5c32ee9ba05cf9ac.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。<br></p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"1788608","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"已知A、B两地相距600千米，甲乙两车同时从A、B两地相向而行，3小时相遇。若甲的速度是乙的1.5倍，则甲的速度是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"60千米/小时"},{"k":"B","t":"80千米/小时"},{"k":"C","t":"90千米/小时"},{"k":"D","t":"120千米/小时"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设乙的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千米/小时，甲的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ce7a5952347b40b9.png\" />千米/小时，由题目可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-afab7e77ecb66dc7.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5b7d7a1b00d8c071.png\" />，则甲速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8bfe0e19d06a0678.png\" />千米/小时。</p><p>方法二：因甲、乙时间相同，且甲速度是乙的1.5倍，则甲的路程∶乙的路程<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c793ae1bc0b6efa.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-838e043e55fb6283.png\" />，共5份。已知总路程为600千米，所以一份为120千米，甲的路程为360千米，所以甲的速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-052efc73008316a4.png\" />千米/小时。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"1791784","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某班有40名学生，一次数学测验共有两道题，答对第一题的有27人，答对第二题的有23人，两题都答对的有15人，则两题都答错的人数是（  ）。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3"},{"k":"B","t":"5"},{"k":"C","t":"6"},{"k":"D","t":"7"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据两集合容斥原理问题公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-318cb92a8592dbbd.png\" />，得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6b510b02dc48aaa8.png\" />，解得两题都错的人数为5。</p><p>故正确答案为B。<br></p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2032184","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某项工程由工作效率相同的甲、乙两工程队承担。若甲、乙两队合做，工期可提前5天；若两队先合做6天，余下的由甲队独做，恰好也能按工期完成，则该工程的工期是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"14天"},{"k":"B","t":"15天"},{"k":"C","t":"16天"},{"k":"D","t":"18天"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>赋值两个工程队的效率均为1，设该工程的工期为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />天，根据题意可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-14bff973f2eba5e0.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-daedbbf793d3e6bd.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。<br></p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"1788618","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小王以每股10元的相同价格买入A和B两只股票共1000股，此后A股先跌<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />再涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，B股先涨<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />再跌<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，若此期间小王没有再买卖过这两只股票，则现在这1000股股票的市值是：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"10250元"},{"k":"B","t":"9975元"},{"k":"C","t":"10000元"},{"k":"D","t":"9750元"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设买入的A股票为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />股，则买入的B股票为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f1513b3c5bc1208d.png\" />股。A股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-58d846b6cddd64a5.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-38ff83e255ca8ebf.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f4c6dd9ec618169a.png\" />元，B股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f103942583a1ab8e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b6098daf124cf527.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-abb162cb5b9ecdac.png\" />元，则两只股票的市值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-299a4dd7c46f3987.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-44b7a5cc2fca5dee.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e50ae4f20d2b393a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d9cbcad724459d9c.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"1788622","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>下图是由三个边长分别为4、6、x的正方形所组成的图形，直线AB将它分成面积相等的两部分，则x的值是：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1537941f0c08d42.jpg\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3或5"},{"k":"B","t":"2或4"},{"k":"C","t":"1或3"},{"k":"D","t":"1或6"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>如图所示，将原图补成一个长方形，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ecb8461afb10e396.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-580d926deefc7d07.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-37a1d435b71b4450.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d36ab3a03155bb9.png\" />。根据题意，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8809bd4432514970.png\" />，又<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7faa3060cb34494.png\" />，则两个补充的长方形面积相等，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3d19463dc553bb8f.png\" />，整理得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6b13693dc222251c.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9c71dfb10ef9ebac.png\" />。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1536e37d563b40f.png\" /></p><p>秒杀技巧：因直线AB将图形分成了面积相等的两个部分，故可将图形视为中心对称图形，此时两边两个小正方形一定全等，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-451f4013816859d5.png\" />，只有B项满足。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"}]}]}